 "title": "Scheme-Frobenius forms of Weil equivariance",
 "statement": "Precomposing the vertical maps of the three squares of\n[thm-pur-weil-equivariance-of-purity-and-trace] with the\ncorresponding $\\kappa_X$ or $\\kappa_Y$ of\n[def-pur-scheme-geometric-frobenius] gives the same three squares\nfor the scheme-Frobenius maps $u_N$.",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-six-functors/sk-thm-sf-package/prop-pur-weil-equivariance-scheme-frobenius.md",
  "place": "node prop-pur-weil-equivariance-scheme-frobenius, order 2239"
 },
